<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Wedlock Forgot Password</title>
</head>

<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #F4F4F4; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; min-height: 100vh; padding: 1rem;">
    <div style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px; background-color: #FFFFFF; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0px 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); text-align: center;">
        <div>
            <a href="https://www.wedlock.au">
                <img src="https://wedlock.au/newlogo.png" alt="Wedlock Logo" style="width: 200px; height: auto; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            </a>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400; color: #4D4D4D; margin-bottom: 10px;">Hello <span style="color: black; font-weight: 600;"><%= name %></span></h2>
            <h3 style="margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #007EAF; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 36px;">Forgot Password?</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #4D4D4D; line-height: 24px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">It happens to the best of us! If you've forgotten your password for Wedlock, no worries. We're here to help you reset it.</p>
            <p style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #4D4D4D;">To reset your password, please use the following recovery code:</p>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <% (activationCode?.split('') || []).forEach((char) => { %>
                    <div style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; color: #007EAF; padding: 10px 15px; border: 2px solid #53ADAE; border-radius: 12px; text-align: center;">
                        <%= char %>
                    </div>
                <% }) %>
            </div>
            <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #4D4D4D;">Click the link below to enter the code and set up a new password:</p>
            <p><a href="https://www.wedlock.au/verify-otp" style="font-size: 16px; color: #007EAF; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none;">Reset Password</a></p>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; margin-top: 20px;">
            <p>The Wedlock Team</p>
            <p><a href="https://www.wedlock.au" style="color: #4D4D4D; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500;">https://www.wedlock.au</a></p>
            <p>Copyright © 2025 Wedlock</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
